OpenAI Whisper models (speech recognition, optional)
  https://github.com/openai/whisper
  Code and model weights licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022
  OpenAI. dubeval/languages.py copies its table of language names
  (whisper/tokenizer.py, LANGUAGES).

BGE-M3 sentence model (optional: the offline meaning screen)
  https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-m3, MIT License. Downloaded on request as the
  int8 ONNX export at https://huggingface.co/Xenova/bge-m3 (MIT), or built by
